Z||000000||AkursedX||08-11-2000||01:10 AM||||Ok, well I'm looking for a pair of 8mm wires, either, MSD or Accel, and I know that they make custom fit ones for the 2.8 V-6, but I can't seem to find any around here, or any service person who can help me out, so I've turned to the internet.  I went to one of them car parts sites (I can't remember which one)  and I think I found the proper wires.  I would buy the custom-fit wires for GM V-6's right?  <BR>I know alot of Fiero owners on this site have these type os wires on their cars and I just want to make sure I'm buying the right ones so I don't have to go through the hassle of returning the wires.  I believe they are the proper one, but I just want to make sure.<BR>Thanks for the feedback  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000001||Uaana||08-11-2000||02:50 AM||||If you are using Summit racing they don't list them in their catalog or on line but if you call the service line at 800-517-1035 and ask for the accell 8.8mm wires for a 2.8 v6 in a fiero they can get you the ones you want for about 60us. shipping incl. should arrive in about 2-3days. with a bunch of stickers and stuff.<BR>wow that was longer than I thought. but hope this helps.||||reg||1
